<dialog id="wux-dialog" />

<view class="top">
  <image class='icon' src="{{iconUrl}}" />
  <view class='line-height'>
    <view class='t-f32 text-black'>填写认证信息</view>
    <view class='t-f24 text-gray margin-top-sm'>登记相关信息作为系统登陆标签</view>
  </view>
</view>

<view class="msg">
  <view class="bar solid-bottom">
    <view class='title'>公司名称</view>
    <input placeholder-class='pclass' placeholder="请输入公司名称" id="company_name" bindinput="inputValue"></input>
  </view>
  <view class="bar solid-bottom">
    <view class='title'>联系电话</view>
    <input disabled type='number' value="{{form.phone}}" id="phone" bindinput="inputValue"></input>
  </view>
  <view class="bar solid-bottom" bindtap="onOpen">
    <view class='title'>公司所在地</view>
    <input disabled name='region' value='{{fn.contact(form.region)}}' id="region" bindinput="inputValue"></input>
    <icon type="i-right " color="grey" size="30"></icon>
  </view>
</view>


<view class="oc fade">
  <view class=" card1" wx:for="{{oc}}" wx:key>
    <card title="{{item.name}}" Icon="titles" Icolor="var(--orange)">
      <view slot="body">
        <grids>
          <grid wx:for="{{item.children}}" hover-class='default' wx:key='grid' bind:click="goList" id="{{item.url}}" thumb="{{item.img}}" label="{{item.name}}">
            <icon wx:if="{{item.icon}}" slot="header" size='56' color='{{}}' type='i-{{item.icon}}'></icon>
          </grid>
        </grids>
      </view>
    </card>
  </view>
</view>




<view class="tip-box">
  <view class="tip-title">
    <icon type="i-warn margin-lr" size="32"></icon>温馨提醒：</view>
  <view class='tip-item'>1. 支付成功后，即获得登陆账户权限，并重新进入小程序。</view>
  <view class='tip-item'>2. 跳转登陆后，您将会看到登陆名有"
    <text class='text-red underline'>$域管理员</text>"的角色，此时表示成功认证为承运商。 </view>
  <view class='tip-item'>3. 电脑端登陆名及账号均为提交时的手机号码（电脑端登陆地址：
    <text class='underline text-red'> https://efafa.vip</text> ) 如遇到问题可联系电话:17354729380，微信同号。</view>
</view>

<cascader visible="{{ visible }}" controlled value="{{ value_addr }}" title="地址选择" options="{{ cantonInfo }}" bind:close="onClose" bind:change="onChange" />


